{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function formatHotkeySequence(sequence): string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L38","children":[{"type":"text","value":"format.ts:38"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Joins stored sequence steps with spaces, preserving physical code tokens.\nFor user-facing labels, call formatForDisplay on each step instead."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"sequence","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sequence"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/Hotkey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Hotkey"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Array of hotkey strings that form the sequence"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A space-separated string (e.g. ['G','G'] → 'G G')"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"formatHotkeySequence(['G', 'G'])      // 'G G'\nformatHotkeySequence(['D', 'I', 'W']) // 'D I W'","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"sequence","text":"sequence","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction formatHotkeySequence(sequence): string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L38)\n\nJoins stored sequence steps with spaces, preserving physical code tokens.\nFor user-facing labels, call formatForDisplay on each step instead.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequence\n\n[`Hotkey`](../type-aliases/Hotkey.md)[]\n\nArray of hotkey strings that form the sequence\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`\n\nA space-separated string (e.g. ['G','G'] → 'G G')\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nformatHotkeySequence(['G', 'G'])      // 'G G'\nformatHotkeySequence(['D', 'I', 'W']) // 'D I W'\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: formatHotkeySequence\ntitle: formatHotkeySequence\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction formatHotkeySequence(sequence): string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L38)\n\nJoins stored sequence steps with spaces, preserving physical code tokens.\nFor user-facing labels, call formatForDisplay on each step instead.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequence\n\n[`Hotkey`](../type-aliases/Hotkey.md)[]\n\nArray of hotkey strings that form the sequence\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`\n\nA space-separated string (e.g. ['G','G'] → 'G G')\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nformatHotkeySequence(['G', 'G'])      // 'G G'\nformatHotkeySequence(['D', 'I', 'W']) // 'D I W'\n```\n"}
